  "text": " So why is why are the CDC? Why is Big Pharma? Why are these other groups so scared of your conference of your big summit on March 25th? So it's a vaccine safety research foundation is sponsoring along with Warner Mendenhall a conference that I, Mary Holland of the Children's Health Defense, Dr. Malone, Dr. Corey, Dr. McCullough, a bunch of people are going to be there and in Atlanta, Georgia, people can still come if they want to. What the they're still available tickets. The reason why there's been a tax on it is because the point and purpose of the conference is to find a way to get legal remedy for the people that have been injured by the vaccine. And the concern by those in positions of power is that they believe that they have abolished any mechanism or means of meaningful remedy for injury from the vaccine because of the immunity by the PREP Act immunity under the childhood immunizations law. All of these aggregate immunities under the contract that Pfizer signed with the Department of Defense, which said, by the way, if you the government give this to anybody, we can never be sued for it. You know, they're wanting they assume that those immunities are impregnable. And we're going to try to find ways to break through those immunities to see whether you can sue based on the employer mandating it, whether you can sue under various state tort law theories that may be outside of the governance of these immunity laws, challenge the laws themselves as unconstitutional. A woman in Washington, DC just filed suit because her two kids were given the vaccine at a Ronald McDonald's mobile clinic without her knowing about it. And the kids were tricked into getting it by lies and deceits by a prominent Georgetown healthcare official doctor who is running those clinics. So that's why we'll get continued blowback and continued efforts to not have, you know, the press won't cover it just like they won't cover the Brooktax in case they don't want people to know there might be remedies and relief out there for the injuries they suffered from the vaccine.",
